units lj
atom_style atomic
boundary p p p
pair_style lj/cut 2.5
lattice fcc 1.0
region box block 0 4 0 4 0 4
create_box 1 box
create_atoms 1 box
mass 1 1.0
pair_coeff 1 1 1 1
neighbor 0.3 bin
fix relax all box/relax iso 0.0 vmax 0.001
minimize 1e-12 1e-12 3000 20000
unfix relax
write_data equilibrated.data
